  "notes": [
    "cc = standard MIDI CC (7-bit, one-way, documented). name = device/display name.",
    "b3 in the SysEx write is NOT addressing: it only takes 0x00,0x08..0x38 and varies independently of block/param/value. Meaning undetermined; 0x00 was used in every capture.",
    "reverb 的 effect_types id 不是连续的：设备在 variant 4 上不使用该槽位，7 个类型分别落在 id 0,1,2,3,5,6,7。依据：CC47 逐值写入 0..6 并回读 0x63 快照，type 依次为 Room/Plate/Hall/Concert/Spring/Shimmer/Cloud，写入 4 落在 id 5 上，写入 >=7 被钳在 id 7。按手册的产品顺序（room..cloud）顺序填 0..6 会整体错位。"
  ],
